    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nExceptionally well located, this substantial two-bedroom semi-detached bungalow offers an excellent opportunity for those looking for a home in one of Westport's most sought after residential areas. Situated less than a ten-minute walk from the town centre, the property benefits from being highly convenient and an enviable location close to all local amenities\n\nWith a floor area of approximately 117sqm/1,250 sq ft, accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, a large light filled living room, Galley style kitchen and dining room with double doors to the rear patio, two double bedrooms (master -en-suite) with Croagh Patrick Views, shower room and hotpress. The property is presented in good condition; however, it would benefit from some modernisation in parts.\n\nExternally, the property sits on a site extending to approximately 0.12 hectares (0.3 acres). Ample parking is provided to the front and side, while the rear features a private garden and patio area. The garden would benefit from some minor investment to maximise it's potential. \n\nThe house is conveniently situated along the Westport to Leenane Road in the townland of Carrowbaun, a sought-after, family friendly area, a short drive from Westport Town and all its amenities, including primary and secondary schools, shops, churches, sports clubs, bars and restaurants \n\nViewing of this property is recommended\n\nOffers in Excess of 395,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.45m x 1.19\nTiled floor, feature stained glass window\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.68m x 1.58m\n\n\n& - 4.05m x 1.58m\n\n\n& - 1.43m x 1.22m\nSolid oak floor\n\nLiving Room - 5.43m x 4.24m\n\n\n& - 5.03m x 2.1m\nSolid oak floor, electric stove, high ceiling, Croagh Patrick Views\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6.81m x 2.5m\nSolid oak floor, tiled backsplash, shaker style galley kitchen, formica worktop, slide door to patio\n\nBedroom One - 4.2m x 3.57m\nCarpeted floor, built in wardrobes, high ceilling, Croagh Patrick views\n\nBedroom Two - 5.9m x 3m\nLaminate floor, reek views\n\nEn-Suite - 2.64m x 1.85m\nFully tiled, wet room shower, wc, whb\n\nBathroom - 2.82m x 2.06m\nTiled floor and backsplash, electric shower, wc, whb\n\nHotpress - 1m x 0.88m\nShelved\n\n"
